          <div class="nearby-card reveal"><div class="nearby-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598096956890-a7d0d08779b6?q=80');"></div><div class="nearby-info"><h4>Historical Museum</h4><p>Ancient artifacts & history</p></div></div>
