          <div class="fleet-pill-icon">🚌</div>
          <div>
            <span class="fleet-name">Luxury Mini Coach</span>
            <span class="fleet-desc">For Large Groups • 17 to 25 Seats</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="amenities-box">
          <p class="amenities-label">Standard Amenities:</p>
          <div class="amenities-list">
            <span class="amenity">❄️ Dual AC</span>
            <span class="amenity">💺 Push-back Seats</span>
